            "default_value": "<p>Book a meeting with a business development manager at Maverick Frame to discuss your new upcoming project and see our best work:<\/p>\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li>Take a look behind the scenes of our work and see how product renders are created from scratch — from a plain model to a fully textured object.<\/li>\r\n    <li>Explore how our team of 3D artists brings ideas to life<\/li>\r\n    <li>Discover our additional services, including motion design and 2D animation<\/li>\r\n    <li>Get a free consultation with a 3D artist about your project development right during the meeting.<\/li>\r\n    <li>Browse our portfolio — we’ll handpick the most relevant examples tailored specifically to your needs.<\/li>\r\n<\/ul>",
